{%- comment -%}
  lb-speculation-rules.liquid
  Version:      1.2.0
  Last updated: 2026-08-16
  Purpose:      Injects Speculation Rules API JSON to prerender navigation
                targets on hover, reducing perceived load time for next-page
                navigation (Chrome 109+ only — degrades gracefully in all
                other browsers, the script tag is simply ignored).

  Eagerness tiers:
    "moderate"   — Triggers prerender on link hover (~200ms). Balanced: fires
                   on user intent signal without wasting bandwidth on every link.
    "conservative" — Triggers on pointerdown (click-start). Lowest waste, but
                   only ~100ms of head start before navigation commits.

  v1.2.0 changes:
    - Collection URLs raised from conservative → moderate
      Rationale: main nav collection links are high-intent hover targets;
      the majority of hover → click happens on collection nav items.
      Wasted prerenders are minimal (collections are CDN-heavy, cheap to serve).

  Exclusions (never prerender):
    /cart*      — Shopify cart state is session-sensitive; prerendering can
                  cause stale item counts or incorrect discount application.
    /checkout*  — Payment pages must never be prerendered.
    /account*   — Auth-gated pages; prerendering bypasses Shopify's auth check.
    /collections/*/products/*?variant=*
                — Variant-parameterized URLs are fine to prerender but the
                  excluded patterns above cover the higher-risk cases.

  Usage:        Rendered in layout/theme.liquid before </body>.
  Dependencies: None — degrades gracefully in unsupported browsers.

  References:
    https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/prerender-pages
    https://wicg.github.io/nav-speculation/speculation-rules.html
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Only inject on non-admin, non-design-mode pages. Speculation rules in the
  theme editor can cause unexpected section rerenders.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless request.design_mode -%}
<script type="speculationrules">
{
  "prerender": [
    {
      "where": {
        "and": [
          { "href_matches": "/collections/*/products/*" },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "*variant=*" } }
        ]
      },
      "eagerness": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "and": [
          { "href_matches": "/products/*" },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "*variant=*" } }
        ]
      },
      "eagerness": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "and": [
          { "href_matches": "/collections/*" },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/collections/*/products/*" } }
        ]
      },
      "eagerness": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "and": [
          { "href_matches": "/*" },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/cart*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/checkout*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/account*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/password*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/challenge*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/collections/*/products/*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/products/*" } },
          { "not": { "href_matches": "/collections/*" } }
        ]
      },
      "eagerness": "conservative"
    }
  ],
  "prefetch": [
    {
      "where": { "href_matches": "/search*" },
      "eagerness": "conservative"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endunless -%}
